                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>On June 10 the Secretary of State informed the Embassy in France that “We are
                    greatly interested” in the “nature of long-range plans French are now
                    contemplating for North Africa”, and he described a possible line of action by
                    the United States. For documentation on this subject, see <ref
                        target="frus:frus1947v05">volume V</ref>, compilation entitled “Interest of
                    the United States in Communist and Nationalist Activities in North Africa”.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
